        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reese Witherspoon, Paul Rudd\n- Works: Overnight Delivery, The Man in the Moon\n- Places: New Orleans, Tennessee\n- Topics: acting careers, early film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Reese Witherspoon was born in New Orleans and raised in Tennessee.\n- Reese Witherspoon began her career as a child actress.\n- In 1991, Reese Witherspoon made her professional screen debut in \"The Man in the Moon.\"\n- Reese Witherspoon was nominated for a Young Artist Award for \"The Man in the Moon.\"\n- \"Overnight Delivery\" featured Reese Witherspoon and Paul Rudd before both became considerably bigger film stars.",
